# The two exclusions above are pattern matches at any depth, and they were
# silently swallowing published evidence: results/logs/ holds the log the Progent
# disclosure cites, and results/runs/ is half the denominator of the B-vs-C
# result. Both are re-included here. Scanned for credentials before publishing.
!results/runs/
!results/runs/**
!results/logs/
!results/logs/**
